{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/d1-west-nakheel-mbr-district-1","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":561,"crm_id":"289","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"D1 West","slug":"d1-west-nakheel-mbr-district-1","display_address":"MBR District 1","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Nakheel","price":59890000,"display_price":"","lattitude":25.1524209,"longitude":55.2770388,"min_bedrooms":4,"max_bedrooms":6,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>D1 West - a luxury development that is a collection of <strong>4-6 bedroom villas</strong> located along the coastline and 7 bedroom mansions located on a separate island. Each residence has its own private pool. Each villa has a unique design in a modern style. High quality natural materials are used in the finishing, and thanks to panoramic windows all the wall rooms are filled with natural light and creates a cosy atmosphere.</p><p>Residents have access to a private beach by a picturesque lagoon, a small but cosy park with many places for recreation and jogging and walking paths and a green garden with playgrounds and sports grounds. There are schools, nurseries, shops and a mosque within walking distance.</p><p>D1 West has a unique location in MBR City. Meydan Racecourse, Meydan Golf, the famous Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary and the Business Bay area are just 5 minutes away. Burj Al Arab, Palm Jumeirah and Dubai International Airport can be reached in 15 minutes.</p><p>The complex offers a unique resort lifestyle to suit all ages. Surrounded by a lagoon and green spaces, the villas are the perfect place for those seeking comfort and harmony.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/289/images/2023/07/12/O7oSpsuFYcedpaFg2f0nVOnrsZ4VX1XP4v